-- TYPE MISMATCH -------------------------------------- src/OutputController.elm

The 2nd argument to `list` is not what I expect:

150|         packet = E.object [("viewProtocol",E.int 1),("kind",E.string "view-commit"),("projection",frame current),("requests",E.list identity requests),("focus",E.list identity focus)]
                                                                                                                                                  ^^^^^^^^
This `requests` value is a:

    List D.Value

But `list` needs the 2nd argument to be:

    List Scope

Hint: I always figure out the argument types from left to right. If an argument
is acceptable, I assume it is “correct” and move on. So the problem may actually
be in one of the previous arguments!

-- TYPE MISMATCH -------------------------------------- src/OutputController.elm

The 1st argument to `list` is not what I expect:

150|         packet = E.object [("viewProtocol",E.int 1),("kind",E.string "view-commit"),("projection",frame current),("requests",E.list identity requests),("focus",E.list identity focus)]
                                                                                                                                         ^^^^^^^^
This `identity` value is a:

